          "ruleIndex": 3,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "ListBase.allowed moves from slot 100, offset 0 to slot 50, offset 0, so after the upgrade it reads what the old version stored there and its old value is left behind. Fix: Declare the variables in the old order and keep every base contract as it was; add new variables after the last one, or take their slots from a gap."
          },
          "locations": [
