          "message": {
            "text": "The gap ListBase.__gap (uint256[9]) at slot 101, offset 0 is not in the new layout, so ListBase has no room left for new variables that would not move the variables declared after it. This is a best practice of this tool, not a rule in the Solidity or OpenZeppelin documentation. Fix: Keep a gap in every base contract that may grow; drop it only when the variables that replace it take exactly its slots."
